---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
const lang = 'en';
const UPDATED = '2026-10-05';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy policy of the notary fees calculator in France" description="Privacy for the notary fees calculator in France: no cookies, no personal data recorded by the publisher, anonymous stability check, GDPR rights." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This page describes the processing of personal data linked to the use of {SITE_URL}, in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and French Law no. 78-17 of 6 January 1978.</p>
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the calculator does not do</h2>
    <p>The calculation runs in your browser. Price, département, situation and options are not sent to any server and are not stored anywhere; the stability tool described below does not receive them, as the fields are masked. The share link encodes your inputs in the page address: only send it to people of your choice; whoever opens it loads a page whose address contains those values.</p>
    <h2>Processing carried out</h2>
    <p><strong>Connection logs.</strong> The host records the IP address, date, page requested and browser, for the security and diagnosis of the service (legitimate interest, art. 6-1 f GDPR), under its own retention policy.</p>
    <p><strong>No cookies, no recorded data.</strong> The site sets no cookies and the publisher records no personal data: neither the property price, the département nor your first-time buyer status is kept, on our side or on your device.</p>
    <p><strong>Technical stability measurement.</strong> To check that the notary fees and transfer duty calculation works, we anonymously measure errors, loading times, dead clicks and scrolling with Microsoft Clarity, set up without cookies: it sets no <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>, gives each page view its own identifier and does not link visits together; page content and the amounts entered are masked before sending. Tool provider: Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland. Legal basis: the publisher’s legitimate interest in a reliable calculator (art. 6-1 f GDPR). Retention: 30 days (recordings) and 13 months (aggregates).</p>
    <p><strong>Objecting.</strong> Block the clarity.ms domain in your browser or write to us; the calculator still works. No other measurement tool or tracker is loaded: see the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>
    <p><strong>Advertising.</strong> The site displays no advertising.</p>
    <p><strong>Messages.</strong> If you write to the contact address, your address and message are processed to reply to you and kept for at most three years after the last exchange.</p>
    <h2>Recipients and transfers</h2>
    <p>No data is sold or transferred. Acting as processors: the host GitHub, Microsoft (Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited and Microsoft Corporation) for the stability measurement. GitHub and Microsoft Corporation are based in the United States; transfers to them rely on the EU–US Data Privacy Framework, to which they are certified, and on the European Commission’s standard contractual clauses. See the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, portability: write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, reply within one month. You may complain to the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority}: <a href={LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl}</a>. Last updated: {displayDate(UPDATED, 'en-GB')}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
